  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1189887.svg\" alt=\"標題\" width=\"386\" height=\"24\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>說明：</strong></span><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/linear pipes/screen.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;一個資源包，將 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pipez</a> 模組中所有管道的方塊模型與紋理進行改造，使其更美觀並能與 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a> 模組完美搭配！</span></span></p><p><br><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez Mekanism Edition/screen/image.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"展示圖\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez Mekanism Edition/screen/2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"展示圖\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">同時也包含了 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez-mekanism-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pretty Pipez : Mekanism Edition</a> 中的所有物品</span></p><p><br><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez Mekanism Edition/screen/item.png?raw=true\" alt=\"展示圖\" width=\"915\" height=\"454\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此項目融合了 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez-mekanism-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pretty Pipez : Mekanism Edition</a> 的模型與紋理，以及 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smart-pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smart Pipez</a> 的方塊模型邏輯<br></span></p>",
